{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1181774-sun-spirits-in-werewolf-the-apocalypse-please-help","id":1181774,"title":"Sun spirits in Werewolf the Apocalypse(Please help)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-02-02T13:16:59-08:00","id":1181774,"title":"Sun spirits in Werewolf the Apocalypse(Please help)","content":"So basically the title says it all. I've searched almost every book in an attempt to find sun spirits and by that I don't mean Helios him self but his followers. The reason I'm looking for them is because of a talen named Atum arrows that is made to hunt vampires. Most of the books refer to moon spirits such as lunes however none of those I've searched have anything about sun spirits. Who ever knows anything about them please reply I really need information regarding their behavior, taboos, spiritual correspondences, material correspondences, chiminage etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12385-doberman","name":"Doberman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-02T14:35:50-08:00","id":1181806,"title":"","content":"There is a little bit of info. about them in the W20 &quot;Umbra: the Velvet Shadow&quot; book. If you have it, look on page 47.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13713-wilson","name":"Wilson","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"182"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-10T20:14:18-08:00","id":1184599,"title":"","content":"Some fetishes have sunspirits in them and they note individual type qualities like sun spirits of revelation and foresight, and sun spirits evoking purity, ect.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-11T03:30:35-08:00","id":1184679,"title":"","content":"You see, there is a talen called Atumn arrows made to hunt vampires and it requests a sun spirit but it doesn't mention what type. Also none of the books I have mention how and where to find one or how they behave etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12385-doberman","name":"Doberman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-11T03:45:01-08:00","id":1184683,"title":"","content":"&quot;Sun Spirits&quot; can easily refer to the Brood of Helios, as such they would include Falcon spirits (not Falcons brood but only those spirits that represent Falcon), the Talons of Horus, Fire Bird, there is a Sun Warrior spirit (I believe is either connected to the Wendigo or Uktena, but also can be found with Fianna ties). Corn Maiden is also part of Helios Brood and it's worth taking a look in Rage Across the Heavens for some of the residence of Helios Realm. <br /> <br /> Hope this helps.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2767-moirdryd","name":"Moirdryd","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2767_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"490"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-12T15:38:46-08:00","id":1185368,"title":"","content":"I keep wanting to say that the solar counterparts to Lunes are called Helions, but I may be thinking of WtF.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-12T15:47:00-08:00","id":1185373,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>No One of Consequence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1181774-sun-spirits-in-werewolf-the-apocalypse-please-help?p=1185368#post1185368\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I keep wanting to say that the solar counterparts to Lunes are called Helions, but I may be thinking of WtF.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, that's WtF.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-13T10:52:02-08:00","id":1185650,"title":"","content":"I thought so. A pity, as it's a perfectly suitable name for them, I think.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}